# Conversion claims

Sell a specific behaviour and a specific thing the live product does. Summon participation. Do not promise a new life.

Do not use: revolutionary, life-changing, "AI that knows everything about you", guaranteed outcomes, therapy, or an unsupported "better than everyone" claim.

```text
BAD: "The AI knows your whole life and transforms you."
GOOD: "Read the domains. When you are ready, open the app and keep one promise."
```

If a price is shown, it must match the app plans: Free $0, Core $12 a month, Pro $29 a month. There is no public price page yet. Do not invent one inside an unrelated task.

Do not mention credits, challenges, or the ledger unless the sentence matches the live app and the app product state.
